# Ys 8 (Steam)

## Where is the options page?

The [player options page for this game](../player-options) contains most of the options you need to 
configure and export a config file.

## What does randomization do to this game?

The Ys 8 AP Randomizer randomizes rewards in the game and adds several items which are used to as world progression 
(all of Dana's past episodes are converted into items that check all events that could be completed from those episodes).

For example, you need to find the `Maiden's Journal` item to spawn the prayer tree to Primordial Passage.

The goal is to defeat the boss in the Selection Sphere, what spawns the boss is the `goal` setting and which boss you fight is an option.

## What items and locations get shuffled?

### Items

Any party member, castaway, item, and a number of event flags that have been converted to items.

### Locations

Locations the player can find items include:
- Chests
- Static Events
- NPC Rewards

## Which items can be in another player's world?

Any of the items which can be shuffled may also be placed into another player's world.

## When the player receives an item, what happens?

When the player receives an item, your client will display a message displaying the item you have obtained.

